<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean bond yields close lower on high liquidity.</title>
<headline>S.Korean bond yields close lower on high liquidity.</headline>
<text>
<p>Yields on benchmark three-year corporate bonds closed lower on Tuesday on follow-through buying based on the high cash liquidity, dealers said.</p>
<p>Three-month CDs and overnight call rates remained unchanged.</p>
<p>* 3-yr corporates close at 11.90 pct vs Monday's 11.93 pct</p>
<p>* 3-mth CDs end flat at 12.20 pct</p>
<p>* Average overnight call rate flat at 11.5 pct</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
